{"id":"bd7e4207897c8db3","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-logic.md","title":"Logic","display":"df-logic — Logic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-logic","aliases":["93-df-logic"],"display":"df-logic — Logic","depends_on":["[[93-df-formula]]","[[93-df-consequence]]","[[93-df-finite-subset]]","[[93-df-substitution]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-logic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-logic — Logic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c2ca1af9af149e69\" href=\"?note=c2ca1af9af149e69\" title=\"93-df-formula\">93-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"afd7605d365be7b6\" href=\"?note=afd7605d365be7b6\" title=\"93-df-consequence\">93-df-consequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6b63f2f43b5511ee\" href=\"?note=6b63f2f43b5511ee\" title=\"93-df-finite-subset\">93-df-finite-subset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8e602c19b2984096\" href=\"?note=8e602c19b2984096\" title=\"93-df-substitution\">93-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> is a formula-set candidate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is a connective-signature candidate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\\)</span> is the arity-signature predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F\">\\(\\vdash\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F\\)</span> is a relation candidate; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span> abbreviates <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\Gamma,\\varphi\\rangle\\in\\vdash\">\\(\\langle\\Gamma,\\varphi\\rangle\\in\\vdash\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}(\\sigma;\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}(\\sigma;\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\)</span> is the substitution predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8e602c19b2984096\" href=\"?note=8e602c19b2984096\" title=\"93-df-substitution\">93-df-substitution</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}\\)</span> is the type-indexed finitary structural Tarskian-logic predicate defined here; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Logic}\">\\(\\mathrm{Logic}\\)</span> is its existential type-forgetting alias.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}(F,\\vdash)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[\n\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\n\\land F=T_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\n\\land\\vdash\\;\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\Gamma,\\Delta\\subseteq F\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\to\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta\\land\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\Delta\\vdash\\varphi\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl((\\forall\\psi\\in\\Gamma\\;\\Delta\\vdash\\psi)\\land\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\Delta\\vdash\\varphi\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl(\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\exists\\Gamma_0\\in[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(\\Gamma_0\\vdash\\varphi)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\sigma\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}(\\sigma;\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\land\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\widehat\\sigma^{\\tau}[\\Gamma]\\vdash\\widehat\\sigma^{\\tau}(\\varphi)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}(F,\\vdash)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[\n\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\n\\land F=T_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\n\\land\\vdash\\;\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\Gamma,\\Delta\\subseteq F\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\to\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta\\land\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\Delta\\vdash\\varphi\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl((\\forall\\psi\\in\\Gamma\\;\\Delta\\vdash\\psi)\\land\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\Delta\\vdash\\varphi\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl(\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\exists\\Gamma_0\\in[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(\\Gamma_0\\vdash\\varphi)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\sigma\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}(\\sigma;\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\land\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\widehat\\sigma^{\\tau}[\\Gamma]\\vdash\\widehat\\sigma^{\\tau}(\\varphi)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Logic}(F,\\vdash)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau\\;\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}(F,\\vdash)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Logic}(F,\\vdash)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau\\;\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}(F,\\vdash)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The third consequence clause is cut in the direction “if <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> derives every member of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> derives <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>, then <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> derives <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>.” The indexed predicate exposes the exact connective type used by structurality; the unindexed predicate merely forgets that witness.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"c2ca1af9af149e69","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"afd7605d365be7b6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-consequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-finite-subset","status":"resolved","id":"6b63f2f43b5511ee","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-finite-subset]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"8e602c19b2984096","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-similarity-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SimilarityType}$ is the arity-signature predicate of [[93-df-similarity-type]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"8e602c19b2984096","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}(\\sigma;\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93})$ is the substitution predicate of [[93-df-substitution]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\Gamma,\\varphi\\rangle\\in\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}(\\sigma;\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Logic}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}(F,\\vdash)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[\n\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\n\\land F=T_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\n\\land\\vdash\\;\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\Gamma,\\Delta\\subseteq F\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&\\bigl(\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\to\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\bigl(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta\\land\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\Delta\\vdash\\varphi\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\bigl((\\forall\\psi\\in\\Gamma\\;\\Delta\\vdash\\psi)\\land\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\Delta\\vdash\\varphi\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\bigl(\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\exists\\Gamma_0\\in[\\Gamma]^{<\\omega}\\;(\\Gamma_0\\vdash\\varphi)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\sigma\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}(\\sigma;\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\land\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\widehat\\sigma^{\\tau}[\\Gamma]\\vdash\\widehat\\sigma^{\\tau}(\\varphi)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Logic}(F,\\vdash)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau\\;\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}(F,\\vdash)","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":2281,"backlinks":[{"id":"dc3498f98607795c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"def48430496c026c","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F$ is a formula carrier, $\\mathsf L=\\langle F,\\vdash\\rangle$, and $\\mathrm{Logic}(F,\\vdash)$; finitarity is one clause of [[93-df-logic]]."},{"id":"5096907e2ea79ebf","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8af8810b5026b75f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F$ is a formula carrier, $\\tau$ is its connective type, and $\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}(F,\\vdash)$ is the type-indexed logic predicate of [[93-df-logic]]."},{"id":"47e441115dc87ddf","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9e93b2477e743baa","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a55351eb48f8bd69","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e3c8f5c9e577b791","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1bb65160feb13df8","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4b52d3210eeab41d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}$ is the type-indexed finitary str